<main id="main-content">{include file="cloudhost247/includes/product-hero.tpl"}<section class="ch-section"><div class="ch-wrap ch-prose"><details class="ch-faq" open><summary>How do I choose a service?</summary><p>Browse the configured plans and review the resources, billing cycle and terms for your selected product. Contact the team if a requirement is not listed.</p></details><details class="ch-faq"><summary>How do I create an account?</summary><p>Use <a href="{$WEB_ROOT}/register.php">Create Account</a> and complete the registration form. Existing customers can <a href="{$WEB_ROOT}/clientarea.php">sign in to the Client Area</a>.</p></details><details class="ch-faq"><summary>Which payment methods are available?</summary><p>Checkout displays the payment methods enabled for your order. Availability can depend on the product, currency and account.</p></details><details class="ch-faq"><summary>Where can I find renewal and refund terms?</summary><p>Review the <a href="{$WEB_ROOT}/domain-renewal-policy.php">Domain Renewal Policy</a> and <a href="{$WEB_ROOT}/refund-policy.php">Refund Policy</a>, along with the terms of your selected service.</p></details><details class="ch-faq"><summary>How do I get support?</summary><p>Use the <a href="{$WEB_ROOT}/knowledgebase.php">knowledgebase</a> or <a href="{$WEB_ROOT}/submitticket.php">submit a support ticket</a>. For account-specific help, sign in before opening a ticket.</p></details><details class="ch-faq"><summary>How do I request data deletion?</summary><p>Follow the published <a href="{$WEB_ROOT}/data-deletion.php">Data Deletion Instructions</a>. See the <a href="{$WEB_ROOT}/privacy-policy.php">Privacy Policy</a> for information about the handling of personal data.</p></details></div></section>{include file="cloudhost247/includes/site-cta.tpl"}</main>
